    "scope": "已接入官方 Helium 示例选定的 T-Beam V1.1：SSD1306 显示、GPIO38 用户键与低有效红灯 GPIO4。新版 AXP2101、Helium 网络及整机固件尚未验证。",
    "unsupported": [
      "No complete official factory, Meshtastic or SoftRF firmware has been executed; native MMIO tests establish only the stated board protocol subset.",
      "No physical hardware validation, radio propagation, analog supply/battery model or USB electrical emulation is claimed.",
      "Pinned Helium code targets AXP192 V1.1 while the current storefront states AXP2101. This profile deliberately represents the source-backed older V1.1, not every board sold under this handle.",
      "SH1106 optional OLED autodetection/readback and no-OLED variants are not represented. A virtual always-powered OLED rail is assumed.",
      "AXP192/AXP2101, GNSS, SX1276, LoRaWAN/Helium backend, provisioning credentials and complete factory boot are unmodeled.",
      "OLED hardware I2C on both classic ESP32 controllers and software I2C are routed to the documented pins. Continuous scroll, analog contrast/current, readback and electrical signal timing are unmodeled.",
      "The physical board declares 8 MiB PSRAM; the current classic ESP32 backend supports only 0/4 MiB and this profile explicitly allocates 4 MiB. Firmware requiring the full physical capacity is outside this subset."
    ],
    "firmwareCompatibility": "No factory image is claimed working by a board protocol test."
  },
